{'symbol': 'MOS', 'date': '2022-10-19 16:15:00', 'title': 'MOSAIC ANNOUNCES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.15 PER SHARE', 'text': "TAMPA, FL / ACCESSWIRE / OCTOBER 19, 2022 / THE MOSAIC COMPANY (NYSE:MOS) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.15 PER SHARE ON THE COMPANY'S COMMON STOCK. THE DIVIDEND WILL BE PAID ON DECEMBER 15, 2022, TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON DECEMBER 1, 2022."}